      "text": "❌ Multiple Ports Anti-Pattern\n(Port 8080, 8081, 8082, 8083, 8084)\n\n• Windows Firewall asks permission 5 times\n• Auto-discovery beacon must sync 5 ports\n• Strict Wi-Fi / Hotspots block unlisted ports\n• Hard to maintain and debug",
