      "text": "⚡ Why Single Port with Paths Wins:\n\n1. Single Windows Firewall Prompt: User clicks 'Allow' once\n2. 1-Click Auto-Discovery: UDP beacon broadcasts single port (8080)\n3. Independent Sockets: Each path opens its own WebSocket\n   (Heavy camera frames never lag the mouse cursor!)",
